==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|kyssa||to kiss|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{term|lang=gem-pro|*kussijaną}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈcʰɪsːa/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|ɪsːa|lang=is}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb|kyssti|kysst}}

# to [[kiss]]
#: '''''Kysstu''' mig!''
#:: '''Kiss''' me!
#: ''Viltu '''kyssa''' mig?''
#:: Do you want to '''kiss''' me?
#: ''Hefurðu [[einhvern tíma]] '''kysst''' einhvern?''
#:: Have you ever '''kissed''' someone?

